tient-records="<?= htmlspecialchars((string) $patient['id'], ENT_QUOTES, 'UTF-8') ?>"><div class="dashboard-section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Your health information</p><h2>Medical <em>records.</em></h2><p>Records from your care team will appear here when a secure clinical records connection is available.</p></div><span class="portal-status">Clinical records not connected</span></div>
